('page',0,1,5,'en',0,'<style>\r\n.drupwned-about {\r\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;\r\n  color: #2d3748;\r\n  line-height: 1.8;\r\n}\r\n.hero-banner {\r\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a202c 0%, #2d3748 100%);\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  padding: 80px 60px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n  margin: -20px -20px 50px -20px;\r\n}\r\n.hero-banner h1 {\r\n  font-size: 48px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  margin: 0 0 15px 0;\r\n  letter-spacing: -1px;\r\n}\r\n.hero-banner p {\r\n  font-size: 20px;\r\n  opacity: 0.9;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.intro-box {\r\n  background: #f7fafc;\r\n  padding: 40px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  font-size: 18px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 50px;\r\n  border-left: 5px solid #e53e3e;\r\n}\r\n.section-title {\r\n  font-size: 32px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: #1a202c;\r\n  margin: 50px 0 25px 0;\r\n  padding-bottom: 15px;\r\n  border-bottom: 3px solid #e53e3e;\r\n}\r\n.services-grid {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\r\n  gap: 25px;\r\n  margin: 30px 0 50px 0;\r\n}\r\n.service-card {\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n  padding: 30px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);\r\n  transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\r\n  border-top: 4px solid #e53e3e;\r\n}\r\n.service-card:hover {\r\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\r\n}\r\n.service-card h4 {\r\n  font-size: 20px;\r\n  color: #e53e3e;\r\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n.service-card p {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  color: #4a5568;\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n}\r\n.stats-row {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 30px;\r\n  margin: 40px 0;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.stat-box {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-width: 200px;\r\n  background: #1a202c;\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  padding: 30px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n.stat-number {\r\n  font-size: 42px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: #e53e3e;\r\n  display: block;\r\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n}\r\n.stat-label {\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n  opacity: 0.9;\r\n}\r\n.cta-box {\r\n  background: #e53e3e;\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  padding: 50px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  margin-top: 50px;\r\n}\r\n.cta-box h3 {\r\n  font-size: 28px;\r\n  margin: 0 0 15px 0;\r\n}\r\n.cta-box p {\r\n  font-size: 18px;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"drupwned-about\">\r\n  <div class=\"hero-banner\">\r\n    <h1>About Drupwned</h1>\r\n    <p>Your trusted partner in cybersecurity excellence</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"intro-box\">\r\n    Drupwned is a premier cybersecurity consulting firm specializing in web application security assessments and penetration testing. Since 2020, we\'ve protected organizations worldwide by identifying and eliminating critical vulnerabilities before they can be exploited.\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">Our Mission</h2>\r\n  <p>We believe security should be proactive, not reactive. Our team of certified ethical hackers stays ahead of emerging threats, ensuring your digital assets remain secure in an ever-evolving landscape.</p>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"stats-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"stat-box\">\r\n      <span class=\"stat-number\">500+</span>\r\n      <span class=\"stat-label\">Security Engagements</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"stat-box\">\r\n      <span class=\"stat-number\">98%</span>\r\n      <span class=\"stat-label\">Client Satisfaction</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"stat-box\">\r\n      <span class=\"stat-number\">5+</span>\r\n      <span class=\"stat-label\">Years Experience</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">Our Services</h2>\r\n  <div class=\"services-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"service-card\">\r\n      <h4>Penetration Testing</h4>\r\n      <p>Comprehensive security assessments of web applications, APIs, and content management systems.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"service-card\">\r\n      <h4>Vulnerability Assessments</h4>\r\n      <p>In-depth infrastructure analysis to identify and prioritize security weaknesses.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"service-card\">\r\n      <h4>Security Training</h4>\r\n      <p>Hands-on workshops and training programs for development and security teams.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"service-card\">\r\n      <h4>Incident Response</h4>\r\n      <p>Rapid response and forensic analysis when security incidents occur.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"cta-box\">\r\n    <h3>Ready to Secure Your Organization?</h3>\r\n    <p>Our team of certified professionals (OSCP, CEH, GWAPT) is ready to help. Contact us today for a security assessment.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n','','full_html'),
('page',0,1,6,'en',0,'<style type=\"text/css\">\r\n/* Hide the page title */\r\n.page-title {\r\n  display: none !important;\r\n}\r\n.drupwned-about {\r\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;\r\n  color: #2d3748;\r\n  line-height: 1.8;\r\n}\r\n.hero-banner {\r\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a202c 0%, #2d3748 100%);\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  padding: 80px 60px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n  margin: -20px -20px 50px -20px;\r\n}\r\n.hero-banner h1 {\r\n  font-size: 48px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  margin: 0 0 15px 0;\r\n  letter-spacing: -1px;\r\n}\r\n.hero-banner p {\r\n  font-size: 20px;\r\n  opacity: 0.9;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.intro-box {\r\n  background: #f7fafc;\r\n  padding: 40px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  font-size: 18px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 50px;\r\n  border-left: 5px solid #e53e3e;\r\n}\r\n.section-title {\r\n  font-size: 32px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: #1a202c;\r\n  margin: 50px 0 25px 0;\r\n  padding-bottom: 15px;\r\n  border-bottom: 3px solid #e53e3e;\r\n}\r\n.services-grid {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\r\n  gap: 25px;\r\n  margin: 30px 0 50px 0;\r\n}\r\n.service-card {\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n  padding: 30px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);\r\n  transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\r\n  border-top: 4px solid #e53e3e;\r\n}\r\n.service-card:hover {\r\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\r\n}\r\n.service-card h4 {\r\n  font-size: 20px;\r\n  color: #e53e3e;\r\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n.service-card p {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  color: #4a5568;\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n}\r\n.stats-row {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 30px;\r\n  margin: 40px 0;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.stat-box {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-width: 200px;\r\n  background: #1a202c;\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  padding: 30px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n.stat-number {\r\n  font-size: 42px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: #e53e3e;\r\n  display: block;\r\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n}\r\n.stat-label {\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n  opacity: 0.9;\r\n}\r\n.cta-box {\r\n  background: #e53e3e;\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  padding: 50px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  margin-top: 50px;\r\n}\r\n.cta-box h3 {\r\n  font-size: 28px;\r\n  margin: 0 0 15px 0;\r\n}\r\n.cta-box p {\r\n  font-size: 18px;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n<div class=\"drupwned-about\">\r\n<div class=\"hero-banner\">\r\n<h1>About Drupwned</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Your trusted partner in cybersecurity excellence</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"intro-box\">Drupwned is a premier cybersecurity consulting firm specializing in web application security assessments and penetration testing. Since 2020, we\'ve protected organizations worldwide by identifying and eliminating critical vulnerabilities before they can be exploited.</div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Our Mission</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>We believe security should be proactive, not reactive. Our team of certified ethical hackers stays ahead of emerging threats, ensuring your digital assets remain secure in an ever-evolving landscape.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"stats-row\">\r\n<div class=\"stat-box\"><span class=\"stat-number\">500+</span> <span class=\"stat-label\">Security Engagements</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"stat-box\"><span class=\"stat-number\">98%</span> <span class=\"stat-label\">Client Satisfaction</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"stat-box\"><span class=\"stat-number\">5+</span> <span class=\"stat-label\">Years Experience</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Our Services</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"services-grid\">\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n<h4>Penetration Testing</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Comprehensive security assessments of web applications, APIs, and content management systems.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n<h4>Vulnerability Assessments</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>In-depth infrastructure analysis to identify and prioritize security weaknesses.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n<h4>Security Training</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Hands-on workshops and training programs for development and security teams.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n<h4>Incident Response</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Rapid response and forensic analysis when security incidents occur.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cta-box\">\r\n<h3>Ready to Secure Your Organization?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team of certified professionals (OSCP, CEH, GWAPT) is ready to help. Contact us today for a security assessment.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n','','full_html');
